## Predictions (written before the run)
- no measurable recurring cost: the paired on-minus-off difference is within the sham arm's apparent difference, 2 of 2 - the jobs are free at this fort's scale
- a small recurring cost that pairing can see: on-samples run consistently below off-samples within each replicate, same sign in both, and clearly beyond the sham arm's spread
- the method cannot see it either: the sham arm shows an apparent difference as large as the real arm's - within-replicate noise is itself too big, and FPS on this rig is not measurable at this effect size by any 2-replicate design

